# Whole-game route for `story_walk` from New Game: the puzzle plans in story order, each step guarded by its chapter flag (`FLAG>MAP:text`,
# dropped once the flag is set).  Use: SH2_WALK_PLAN="$(grep -v '^#' FILE | paste -sd';')" story_walk --decisions N --search-on-stall 300
